Package: scTreeSim
Title: Simulation of single-cell lineage trees & associated data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates single-cell lineage trees under an Age-Dependent Branching process, with optional multi-type dynamics, and layers multi-modal data on top of a fixed tree: gene expression (Ornstein-Uhlenbeck), sequential (TypeWriter-style) and non-sequential (Edit-and-Silencing / TiDeTree-style) barcodes, and a binary trait model with error and division-triggered mutation spikes.
